#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/ldns.xml:26
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to ldns"
msgstr "Introdução ao ldns"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netlibs/ldns.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>ldns</application> is a fast DNS library with the goal to "
"simplify DNS programming and to allow developers to easily create software "
"conforming to current RFCs and Internet drafts. This packages also includes "
"the <command>drill</command> tool."
msgstr ""
"&quot;<application>ldns</application>&quot; é uma biblioteca &quot;DNS&quot;"
" rápida com a meta de simplificar a programação &quot;DNS&quot; e permitir "
"que os(as) desenvolvedores(as) criem facilmente o software em conformidade "
"com os &quot;RFCs&quot; atuais e os rascunhos da Internet. Esses pacotes "
"também incluem a ferramenta &quot;<command>drill</command>&quot;."

